* Startup-corrected approximate CD4046 VCO-only model, 2026-10-17.
* This is a behavioral approximation, not a manufacturer transistor-level model.
* Original physical pin mapping and K/ROUT parameters are unchanged.
* At DC/time=0, timing current and output are held at zero so ngspice can
* solve the audio circuit's operating point. Oscillation is enabled after 1 ns.
* Run a normal transient analysis with UIC/Use initial conditions DISABLED.
* A DC operating point tests the audio bias; it cannot represent carrier pulses.
* No external dependencies. No phase detectors or demodulator.
* Tested in standalone ngspice 42: reference-buffer DC and reconstructed
* transmitter transient; VCO 56.82/71.02/85.18 kHz at 3.6/4.5/5.4 V control,
* with a 9 V supply, R1=49.7k, C=100p, and 1Meg output load.
* Frequency accuracy depends on timestep and model calibration; bench-test hardware.
*
* Approximate CD4046 VCO ONLY. No phase detectors or demodulator.
* Ports follow physical DIP pin numbers 1 through 16.
* K calibrated to 71 kHz for 49.7k, 100p, VCOin=VDD/2.
.subckt CD4046_VCO_ONLY p1 p2 p3 p4 p5 p6 p7 p8 p9 p10 p11 p12 p13 p14 p15 p16 params: K=0.70574 ROUT=1000
B_RBIAS rb p8 V={max(0,min(V(p9,p8),V(p16,p8)))}
V_RSENSE rb p11 0
R_RLEAK p11 p8 1T
R_INPUT p9 p8 1G
R_INHIBIT p5 p8 1G
V_CREF p7 p8 0
R_CLEAK p6 p7 1T
B_THRESH th p8 V={(V(p6,p7)-0.5*V(p16,p8))/max(0.25*V(p16,p8),0.01)}
R_STATE p16 state 1k
S_STATE state p8 th p8 SCHMITT
.model SCHMITT SW(RON=1 ROFF=1T VT=0 VH=1)
B_CHARGE p7 p6 I={(time < 1n || V(p5,p8)>0.5*V(p16,p8)) ? 0 : K*max(I(V_RSENSE),0)*((V(state,p8)>0.5*V(p16,p8)) ? 1 : -1)}
B_OUTPUT out p8 V={(time < 1n || V(p5,p8)>0.5*V(p16,p8)) ? 0 : ((V(state,p8)>0.5*V(p16,p8)) ? V(p16,p8) : 0)}
R_OUTPUT out p4 {ROUT}
.ends CD4046_VCO_ONLY
